mmune diabetes or other APS II components?"], "requestable_discriminators": ["Positive GAD65/tyrosine phosphatase antibodies", "HbA1c measurement to quantify glycemic trend over 2-4 weeks"], "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.3, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.65, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "mechanism"}, "B2.2": {"id": "B2.2", "label": "Autoimmune Polyendocrinopathy Syndrome Type II with Concurrent Hyperglycemia", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.11817720061393133, "posterior": 0.11817720061393133, "danger": 0.65, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "reopen_triggers": [], "askable_discriminators": ["History of thyroid dysfunction, celiac disease, or vitiligo?"], "requestable_discriminators": ["Thyroid antibody panel (TPO/Tg antibodies), anti-tissue transglutaminase IgA testing"], "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.6, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.6, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "anatomy"}, "B2.3": {"id": "B2.3", "label": "Autoimmune Insulin Receptor Syndrome (Type B Diabetes)", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.07878480040928755, "posterior": 0.07878480040928755, "danger": 0.25, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "reopen_triggers": [], "askable_discriminators": ["History of transient diabetes resolving with corticosteroid treatment?", "Did the hyperglycemia develop over days with no prior metabolic risk factors?"], "requestable_discriminators": ["Insulin receptor binding assay for IgG antibodies", "Insulin and C-peptide levels despite hyperglycemia"], "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.8, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.4, "interrupt_relevance": 0.3, "level